{"id":"37a053154986e417","group":"91","path":"91/91-cor-truth-theory-strength.md","title":"全归纳 TB 与 UTB 的全部算术后果一致","display":"cor-truth-theory-strength — 全归纳 TB 与 UTB 的全部算术后果一致","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-cor-truth-theory-strength","aliases":["91-cor-truth-theory-strength"],"display":"cor-truth-theory-strength — 全归纳 TB 与 UTB 的全部算术后果一致","depends_on":["[[91-thm-typed-conservative]]","[[91-df-truth-strength]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-cor-truth-theory-strength"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-cor-truth-theory-strength</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-truth-theory-strength — 全归纳 TB 与 UTB 的全部算术后果一致"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7e76f1ecb9ab7743\" href=\"?note=7e76f1ecb9ab7743\" title=\"91-thm-typed-conservative\">91-thm-typed-conservative</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c87db4d1858a0009\" href=\"?note=c87db4d1858a0009\" title=\"91-df-truth-strength\">91-df-truth-strength</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 为固定基础算术。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TB},\\mathrm{UTB}\">\\(\\mathrm{TB},\\mathrm{UTB}\\)</span> 为原书完整归纳版本，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C=\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\mathcal C=\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span> 为后果集。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}truth\\text{-}theory\\text{-}strength}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathrm{TB})=\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathrm{UTB})=\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathrm{PA}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}truth\\text{-}theory\\text{-}strength}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathrm{TB})=\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathrm{UTB})=\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathrm{PA}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保守性给一个方向，二者包含 PA 给另一方向。因此任何算术子类（特别是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span>）的后果也相同。\n原备注称加入真理语言归纳就须另列非保守版本，不适用于这里已含完整归纳的 TB 和 UTB；只有实际改变反射或组合公理时才须重新比较。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 7.5，印刷页 55–56。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-thm-typed-conservative","status":"resolved","id":"7e76f1ecb9ab7743","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-thm-typed-conservative]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-strength","status":"resolved","id":"c87db4d1858a0009","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-strength]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TB},\\mathrm{UTB}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C=\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}truth\\text{-}theory\\text{-}strength}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathrm{TB})=\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathrm{UTB})=\\mathrm{Th}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathrm{PA}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Pi_1","display":false}],"bytes":1209,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-207","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-cor-truth-theory-strength]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-207","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-cor-truth-theory-strength]]"}],"outgoing":["7e76f1ecb9ab7743","c87db4d1858a0009"]}